- @polish_union_agenda: Back to the unions.

@prepare_limited
title: Agree the demands: wages and the return to work
subtitle: This month's action; readiness grows (+15); one demand (threshold 40) with a plan to end the action; waits two months.
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.prepareStatus(Q, Q.pl_union_branch).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_un_prepare_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.prepare(Q, Q.pl_union_branch, 'limited');
!}
go-to: result

@prepare_broad
title: Agree the demands: wages and working conditions
subtitle: This month's action; readiness grows (+15); a broader package (threshold 60) with a plan to end the action; waits two months.
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.prepareStatus(Q, Q.pl_union_branch).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_un_prepare_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.prepare(Q, Q.pl_union_branch, 'broad');
!}
go-to: result

@align_strike
title: A joint meeting on the strike
subtitle: This month's action; the branch aligns more with a strike call (+15), which raises compliance.
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.alignStatus(Q, Q.pl_union_branch, 'strike').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_un_align_strike_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.align(Q, Q.pl_union_branch, 'strike');
!}
go-to: result

@align_end
title: A joint meeting on the agreed end
subtitle: This month's action; the branch aligns more with a call to end on agreed terms (+15).
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.alignStatus(Q, Q.pl_union_branch, 'agreed_end').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_un_align_end_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.align(Q, Q.pl_union_branch, 'agreed_end');
!}
go-to: result

@mediate
title: Mediate the dispute with the leadership
subtitle: This month's action; the branch's dissent over a concrete change falls (−8).
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.mediateStatus(Q, Q.pl_union_branch).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_un_mediate_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.mediate(Q, Q.pl_union_branch);
!}
go-to: result

@start
title: Start the protest
subtitle: This month's action; a strike for the agreed demands; every active month draws on the branch fund.
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.strikeStatus(Q, Q.pl_union_branch).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_un_strike_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.startStrike(Q, Q.pl_union_branch);
!}
go-to: polish_strike_steps

@result
new-page: true

= The trade unions

